# Project structure

- Domain UI → `src/components/[domain]/`
- Shared UI (≥2 domains) → `src/components/shared/`
- HTTP + Zod → `src/fetchers/[domain]/`
- Tanstack Query hooks → `src/hooks/[domain]/` (usable from components)
- Global utils/types/constants → `src/utils`, `src/types`, `src/constants` (`utils` usable from components)
- E2E → `e2e/[domain]/[path].spec.ts`
- Next.js routes → `src/app/`; Vite screens → `src/pages/`

Do not call Tanstack Query/`fetch` directly from components — go through `hooks` / `fetchers`.
Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`
